# Xcode
DerivedData/
build/
*.xcuserstate
*.xccheckout
*.moved-aside
*.xcscmblueprint
# Leading **/ matters: a pattern with a slash anywhere but the end is anchored
# to the repo root, so the un-prefixed form never matched a project in a
# subdirectory - which is how xcuserdata ended up tracked in the first place.
**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.playground/

